          en: 'In the Groggy Ring Itomimizu announces that [[roronoa-zoro|Zoro]] and [[sanji|Sanji]] are finished, then has to shout that they are getting up again. When [[foxy|Foxy]] orders a Monster Burger and the Groggy Monsters pull out weapons, he says outright that it is against the rules, while the referee stretches and looks the other way. He takes Zoro’s run at Sanji for one more quarrel, then calls the Straw Hats’ win and explains the prize: a man or the flag. When the crew cries foul at [[nami|Nami]]’s “peanut strategy”, it is he who steers everyone back to the question: whom will [[monkey-d-luffy|Luffy]] pick?',
