          en: 'With his devil fruit [[foxy|Foxy]] slows [[nami|Nami]]’s boat just short of the finish, [[porche|Porche]] wins the first round, and the Foxy Pirates take [[tony-tony-chopper|Chopper]]. For the second, the Groggy Ring, the Straw Hats have only [[roronoa-zoro|Zoro]] and [[sanji|Sanji]] left, since the order of players cannot be changed. Foxy explains that each team has one player who serves as the ball, to be forced through the other side’s ring, and presents his Groggy Monsters: [[hamburg|Hamburg]], [[pickles|Pickles]] and Big Pan, the largest of the three, who towers even over his teammates.',
