          en: 'Years ago Yokozuna lived at the yard of Tom’s Workers with [[tom|Tom]] and his two apprentices, [[iceburg|Iceburg]] and [[franky|Franky]], and it was Franky who taught him the front crawl. He cheered them on while they built the Puffing Tom, the sea train meant to give Water Seven back its hope. Then [[spandam|Spandam]] pinned an attack on a judicial ship on the yard, Tom gave himself up to spare the boys, and Yokozuna was there, beside [[kokoro|Kokoro]], when Franky stood on the rails to stop the train taking Tom away. Franky told him to stay back, and the train ran Franky down.',
