          en: 'On the Rocketman’s track [[monkey-d-luffy|Luffy]] shouts at a giant frog to get out of the way, [[kokoro|Kokoro]] recognises Yokozuna, and he knocks the train clean off the rails. Luffy goes for him demanding an apology and gets thrown back. Kokoro calls the frog over: he only wanted to protect her, but the pirates have not kidnapped her. She tells the others that since [[tom|Tom]] was taken away eight years ago, Yokozuna has challenged the sea train every day, to grow strong enough never to lose anyone he loves again. Now [[franky|Franky]] has been taken too. Yokozuna roars his yes, and Luffy climbs on his back.',
