          en: 'On the night of the attack, shipwrights warn Tilestone that a masked man is sitting outside [[iceburg|Iceburg]]’s room, and he runs there to find more of his workmates lying on the floor. Among them, apparently struck down, are [[rob-lucci|Lucci]] and [[kaku|Kaku]]. Beside himself, he charges the man in the bear mask with his giant mallet. The man hardens his body and the mallet breaks against it; then he takes Tilestone by the arm and knocks him out with a single punch. Later that night the masks come off: the bodies were not Lucci and Kaku at all, and the bear mask hid [[blueno|Blueno]].',
