          en: 'At the main gate of Enies Lobby, Tilestone wades into the Marines and crushes several of them in a single bear hug, while [[peepley-lulu|Lulu]] floors another. Past the gate two giants are waiting, and they knock down even the biggest men of the Franky Family as if they were nothing. The rest keep fighting. [[kiwi-and-mozu|Kiwi and Mozu]]’s blades, [[paulie|Paulie]]’s ropes and [[zambai|Zambai]]’s bazooka finally bring [[oimo-and-kashi|Kashi]] down, and Tilestone and Lulu climb onto the fallen giant’s shoulders and hammer him until he stays down. The other giant turns on everyone still standing.',
