          en: 'Wanze fires hardened noodles, then eats more flour and wraps himself in a fighting suit made of ramen; [[sanji|Sanji]], furious to see food used as a weapon, gets caught in it and slammed around the car. So he picks up two kitchen knives and cuts the suit to pieces: they are in a kitchen, after all. He will not use them on a person, though. When Wanze throws knives at his back and says [[nico-robin|Robin]] is better off dead, Sanji kicks his face into a new shape, and the last kick, which puts it back as it was, sends him through two cars, into the one where [[rob-lucci|Lucci]] and his agents are waiting.',
