          en: 'Nero picks himself up in the car where the CP9 agents are waiting, and [[kaku|Kaku]] explains who he is: according to [[corgi|Corgi]], the newest member of the unit, who knows only four of the Six Powers. Nero swears he will kill [[franky|Franky]]. [[rob-lucci|Lucci]] reminds him that Franky has to be kept alive, tells him he has let his feelings get the better of him, and gives him three seconds to run. At three, Nero flees with Soru; Lucci catches him, drives a Shigan into his back and throws him out of the window into the sea. Then he tells [[kalifa|Kalifa]] what to put in the report: Nero was too weak to be a member.',
