          en: 'The news reaches the courthouse: the Franky Family has broken through the main gate, one of the giant gatekeepers is down and the other, [[oimo-and-kashi|Oimo]], is being overwhelmed. [[spandam|Spandam]], who should be giving the orders, cannot be reached. So the Marines turn to the three-headed chief justice, and he takes charge of the defence of Enies Lobby. His first order sends a hundred men of the Watchdog Unit of the Law, the courthouse’s own guard, to join the soldiers already at the front.',
