          en: 'Twenty years earlier, on the island of Ohara, he runs the library in the Tree of Knowledge and keeps an eye on [[nico-robin|Robin]], a girl the rest of the island shuns. When she passes the exam at eight and becomes a scholar of archaeology, he celebrates with her. Then Robin asks to join the scholars in studying the Void Century, and he refuses at once: the World Government forbids that history, and a girl so young has no business near it.',
