          en: 'With the scholars rounded up outside the tree, he is allowed to speak to the Five Elders over a transponder snail. He tells them what Ohara has pieced together: hundreds of years ago a great kingdom vanished just as the World Government came to power, and the Poneglyphs were carved so that its history could not be erased completely. Before he can say the kingdom’s name, [[spandine|Spandine]] shoots him on the Elders’ order, and the Buster Call is summoned.',
