          en: 'Twenty years earlier he lands on Ohara as chief of CP9, sent to show the world what happens to anyone who studies the Void Century. On the beach a woman fires a rifle at him, but the bullet only grazes his sleeve. He calmly explains why he has come, and his agents strike her down. His men storm the Tree of Knowledge and round up the scholars, and he arrives with the unconscious woman, [[nico-olvia|Olvia]], carried along as proof of their guilt.',
